▌ Alerts
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

▎ ℹ Note
▎ Alerts render with an icon and a colour bar.

▎ ✦ Tip
▎ Press ? for help.

▎ ‼ Important
▎ Checkbox clicks write back to the file.

▎ ▲ Warning
▎ Mermaid needs mmdc (or mermaid-ascii) on your PATH.

▎ ✖ Caution
▎ Untrusted plugins can't run programs.

